id: pm-1ke3mz
title: Exclude the dated ecosystem planning review from the npm tarball to restore publication headroom
description: "PR 1688 (annotation read fidelity) failed Gates (static) at the package artifact gate: unpacked_size 20,006,092 B against the 20,000,000 B base ceiling. The PR adds about 25 KB of legitimate code, declarations, bundle chunks and docs. pm-dwy8kb restored about 31 KB on 2026-11-08, and PRs 1685 and 1687 consumed most of it. docs/ECOSYSTEM_PLANNING_REVIEW.md (17,581 B) is a dated, repository-only all-status census from 2026-09-28. It belongs to the same class as the already excluded docs/ecosystem-review-*.json evidence: no runtime path, guide topic or packaged relative link needs it apart from one row in docs/README.md. Excluding it from the npm files list, as pm-dwy8kb did for the generated refusal-closure census, restores about 17.5 KB of base headroom. The ceiling stays unchanged. The structural growth sources recorded on pm-998juj (CHANGELOG.md and dist/sdk/public-surface.json) remain open there."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
