acceptance_criteria: "package.json files excludes docs/ECOSYSTEM_PLANNING_REVIEW.md and the 20,000,000 B base ceiling is unchanged; docs/README.md links the page by canonical GitHub URL and states the npm exclusion beside the link; scripts/release/docs-reachability-exceptions.json declares the page with its reason; the package artifact gate passes on the PR 1688 head in hosted CI"
parent: pm-998juj
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "package.json files excludes docs/ECOSYSTEM_PLANNING_REVIEW.md, the 2026-09-28 dated planning census and the same class as the already excluded docs/ecosystem-review-*.json evidence. docs/README.md links it by canonical GitHub URL and states the npm exclusion beside the link. scripts/release/docs-reachability-exceptions.json declares it with its reason. The 20,000,000 B base ceiling is unchanged."
expected_result: The PR 1688 head passes the package artifact gate without raising the ceiling
actual_result: "A clean build measured by package-artifact-gate.mjs reports distribution_size 19,990,897 B (1,591 files, ok true), 9,103 B under the unchanged ceiling; docs-skills-gate passes"
