comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-08T14:20:58.881Z","harness:claude-code","Evidence on branch fix/annotation-read-fidelity. Hosted Gates (static) for the PR 1688 head bfc2b67e6 failed the package artifact gate at unpacked_size 20,006,092 > 20,000,000. After this change, a clean local build (dist removed, pnpm build) measured with scripts/release/package-artifact-gate.mjs reports distribution_size 19,990,897 B over 1,591 files, ok true, so the base headroom is 9,103 B with the ceiling unchanged. Excluding the 17,581 B page saved its full size; the rest of the delta is the retry fix from the PR 1688 review. docs-skills-gate passes with the new reachability exception. Headroom is thin again. Each feature PR adds roughly 25-30 KB, so the structural sources on pm-998juj (CHANGELOG.md at 528,580 B packed, and dist/sdk/public-surface.json at 2,029,911 B, already minified) remain the real lever. docs/CHATGPT_CODEX_PLUGIN_IMPLEMENTATION.md (38,076 B) is the next repository-only candidate, but packaged docs/CODEX_PLUGIN.md links it relatively, so excluding it needs a link decision."
  "2026-11-08T16:07:59.231Z","harness:claude-code","CodeRabbit re-review of PR 1688: linked pnpm quality:package-artifact as a test, since the docs gate does not measure size. After the review fixes, a clean build measures distribution_size 19,994,238 B with ok true, so 5,762 B of base headroom remain under the unchanged 20,000,000 B ceiling. The next feature PR will need another pm-998juj tranche."
